<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence continues across South Sudan as an army captain and a civilian were killed in cattle-raid clashes in Abyei and seven children were released from armed forces and reunited with families in Western Equatoria. Machar confirmed Regina Joseph Kaba as acting SPLM-IO chair, denied involvement in Majur’s failed evacuation, and defended the acting leader while questioning family-visit restrictions and nighttime searches. Local actors are pursuing community solutions, with Uror communities seeking local conflict resolution and clan elders meeting over boundary disputes. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOaVdFTlZVQlkxQ01kMktWd1JFNkxpdExBaDRrSlJFcVRMdXJqVkdvZFZhdE5LbGNTZU9HMjh0Y1FFMDA1S25GVDZucFM1QnJfMVZjZFpBXzE3Z3FrNDhjRkZPU2VKX0tGUXV3S2w0RGRleFhXSjFwYk9aWk4xdGJySUpR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNWFZYTXZWVi1rUXQxazc3R1pRcW5BRmRDc0o1NkZDaHIzTmYxOXVkaWtzUXhsT2MzVGpHMEFNSWxiSkdxdGVYb3dsQXp5YkNGYVhGbGF2R18wclNMdlBZeFByam9sbmVOR3RtcDlDZVpreUJic1d1bHNOamVNeF84X1dBdkxUckU0MmppRUpIN08tSU5hNlFVRTZWVFRxUmhfaVV2OUp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tanzania Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVHBCM1FHNk1EZ2ViR1pBOVZ1RS1uY0pIVV9lOHFKbVBRMkFCTzdSdGc5X00xY1FOMm82MFpjMWwyek95OWc0enE0MHcyTTdXQ0NFTElwWi1HdTIxQk5uNkZsSTEwTlluZ044TVB0VE5SQlZDcjBDVVk3aDZpWEVGY0VYQWtjWGlya3JYRHlBMjRHTU5ON0N3dVVhVlNZbm9Na2xF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQblNhOFlJUng2dVo4RzZBR2tjdGRUaXZmUEJteU13NE9TUjNOdk5hVjlMcmhRWXZ0VWZOZzVCMVNoY2tZLXpFR2FndUUtSm1RUnBvZ3ZrNTkwTGlkTWlqZVdrc1VaZ1VmS21PNGZZaWlRMjZCbXYxbUVxMThra3JIX1hqWG12VkFnTWhmRmNMb1l4VDlsZ